  lines:
  - <?MementoTwoTalk><wave a*.5>I know you're tired but-
  - <?MementoTwoTalk><wave a*.5>Do you mind helping me move the crib?
  - <?PlayerTalk><wiggle a*.5>Oh, the crib... sure...
  - <?MementoTwoTalk><wave a*.5>Thank you, dear.
  - <?MementoTwoTalk><wave a*.5>We should be ready now!
  - <?MementoTwoTalk><wave a*.5>Just a few more days until...
  - <?MementoTwoTalk><wave a*.5>Hm? Heading out? This late?
  - "<?MementoTwoTalk><wave>Please be careful\u2026"
  - <?PlayerTalk>...
  - <?GoToLevel6> \n
